Error [E0201]: `consume` needs `^` here — this value can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/take_required.jet:11:13
    |
 11 |     consume(n)
    |             ^
 Why: parameter 1 takes ownership (`^`); passing `n` without `^` would have to copy it, but this type can't be copied
 Fix: write `^n` to move ownership to `consume`
